                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52b4627a-5f06-4007-80df-cf8a8bf78dcb",
                                                "sense_id": "9dcec7a0-4e7d-3c45-9db5-1defde69f071",
                                                "text": "I'm determined to get a good grade on my exam."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "348222f3-c666-4503-8fa6-e49a79823a73",
                                                "sense_id": "9dcec7a0-4e7d-3c45-9db5-1defde69f071",
                                                "text": "The result of this is that today in most parts of the Western World even the most determined opponents of socialism derive from socialist sources their knowledge on most subjects on which they have no firsthand information."
